  "worked_solution": "Using the triangle inequality, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u20166u+v\u2016 & \\le \u20166u\u2016+\u2016v\u2016.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u20166u+v\u2016 & \\le 6\u2016u\u2016+\u2016v\u2016 \\\\ 11 & \\le 6\u2016u\u2016+2 \\\\ 9 & \\le 6\u2016u\u2016 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & \\le \u2016u\u2016.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $\u2016u\u2016$ is $\\frac{3}{2}.$",
